# Prompt 14 — Final Demo Content Prompt

Create three polished demonstration cases for BugPilot AI:

1. Python — IndexError
2. JavaScript — TypeError from accessing a property of an undefined value
3. C++ — Array out-of-bounds access

For each case provide:
- Short title
- Error message
- Minimal broken code
- What BugPilot should identify
- A concise corrected version

Keep the examples easy to understand in a 2–3 minute hackathon demo.
Do not execute code.
